{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:21 2026-10-20 HKT</p>\n<p>網上今日（10月20日）先後流傳兩段短片，顯示銅鑼灣鬧市及沙田乙明邨對開，無獨有偶均有兩地牌私家車剷上行人路，險象環生，引起網民熱議。</p>\n<p>其中在銅鑼灣怡和街和記利佐治街之間的行人過路處，網上流傳一部FU牌銀色私家車，不知何故突然打橫剷上過路處，然後停下不動。未幾，司機似乎知道自己行錯路，便扭右返回怡和街駛走。</p>\n<p>拍片目擊者事後仍有餘悸，直言當時「剷上嚟嗰下以為死神來了」；不少網民也留言抨擊司機，指其是「大地任我行」。</p>\n<img alt=\"一部FU牌銀色私家車突然剷上怡和街和記利佐治街之間的行人過路處。Threads：05wongmafansThreads：\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4241f19637d581e835c1208aeac059ad/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-20-20h02m33s320.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"途人面面相覷。Threads：05wongmafansThreads：\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37c801e6da922cb62588751785595433/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-20-20h02m58s464.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"事件引來途人圍觀。Threads：05wongmafansThreads：\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d8c082bebeb9cb653a6ace6e8e36e14/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-20-20h17m39s539.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"FU牌私家車最後返回怡和街駛走。Threads：05wongmafansThreads：\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/633ae65f394e925cd7a263935572ad5f/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-20-20h17m27s772.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"FU牌私家車最後返回怡和街駛走。Threads：05wongmafansThreads：\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a2a058b43e7b26de6034173709bdc23/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-20-20h03m06s121.png\"/>\n<p>另一片段則是沙田乙明邨街及沙角街交界，片段可見一部兩地牌黑色SUV剷上一處行人過路處，之後由另一方向出口離開，過程中無視汽車旁邊的街坊途人，險象環生。</p>\n<p>片段流傳引來網民嘩然，紛紛指「好癲」、「仲衰過直接衝紅燈」；而目擊者稱經1823舉報後，已被轉介至電子報案，交警方跟進。</p>\n<img alt=\"一部兩地牌黑色SUV剷上乙明邨街及沙角街交界的過路處。Threads：_hyin_19\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ffaadd7cc76123040d80c20ad9de6f75/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-20-20h06m44s512.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"一部兩地牌黑色SUV剷上乙明邨街及沙角街交界的過路處。Threads：_hyin_19\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a1752d362c3b9c2a8f8dc3e5035371e7/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-20-20h06m51s498.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"SUV近距離駛過途人。Threads：_hyin_19\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07fe63c4cf2ef3426d06fd23e9ad27a1/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-20-20h07m01s010.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"SUV最後往乙明邨街方向駛走。Threads：_hyin_19\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1db2c27bb4b47201b0b7c1e400503a98/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-20-20h07m08s160.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"SUV最後往乙明邨街方向駛走。Threads：_hyin_19\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5bc132f2fee7e7d030c20d879602c88b/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-20-20h07m13s698.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T14:01:49.762634+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":371,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T12:47:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T01:18:28.931282+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T13:57:45.733661+00:00","content_hash":"95cf0b880f5ac997bf1e9ab03ff2f9ff76a5040cccee87487bbc913c1310a8e4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}